{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36738","headline":"寒食日早出城东 · 罗隐","name":"寒食日早出城东","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青门欲曙天，车马已喧阗。\n禁柳疎风雨，墙花拆露鲜。\n向谁夸丽景，只是叹流年。\n不得高飞便，回头望纸鸢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36738.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36738","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}